      "worked": "Divide each numerator and denominator by their HCF.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{15}{20}&=\\frac{15\\div5}{20\\div5}=\\frac34\\\\\\frac{25}{100}&=\\frac{25\\div25}{100\\div25}=\\frac14\\\\\\frac9{81}&=\\frac{9\\div9}{81\\div9}=\\frac19\\\\\\frac{60}{100}&=\\frac{60\\div20}{100\\div20}=\\frac35\\\\\\frac{12}{18}&=\\frac{12\\div6}{18\\div6}=\\frac23\\\\\\frac{40}{80}&=\\frac{40\\div40}{80\\div40}=\\frac12\\end{align*}$$",
